msgid "∨"
msgstr ""

msgid "Welcome to OpenClash"
msgstr "欢迎使用 OpenClash"

msgid ""
"Follow the 5 steps below to finish the first time setup. Every step can "
"be done right on this page, and your progress is remembered."
msgstr "按下面 5 个步骤完成首次配置，每一步都能在本页完成，进度会被记住。"

msgid "Checking status..."
msgstr "正在检查状态..."

msgid "Install the core"
msgstr "安装内核"

msgid "Add a config"
msgstr "添加配置"

msgid "Select the config"
msgstr "选择配置"

msgid "Mode & dashboard"
msgstr "模式与控制面板"

msgid "Common options"
msgstr "常用选项"

msgid ""
"OpenClash needs a Mihomo core. The one click button below matches the "
"core to your CPU, downloads it and installs it."
msgstr ""
"OpenClash 需要 Mihomo 内核。下面的一键安装会根据您的 CPU 架构匹配、下载并"
"安装对应内核。"

msgid ""
"Your CPU architecture is detected automatically (see the button below), "
"so normally you only need one click."
msgstr "CPU 架构会自动识别（见下方按钮旁），通常情况下只需点一次即可。"

msgid ""
"Keep the default mirror. Use “Manual selection” only when the download is "
"slow or failed."
msgstr "保持默认下载源即可，仅当下载缓慢或失败时才使用“手动选择”。"

msgid "Wait until the progress below reports success, then continue."
msgstr "等待下方进度显示成功后，再继续下一步。"

msgid "Install core"
msgstr "安装内核"

msgid "Manual selection"
msgstr "手动选择"

msgid ""
"One click downloads and installs the core. Progress is shown in the log "
"area."
msgstr "一键下载并安装内核，进度会显示在日志区域。"

msgid ""
"A config holds your proxies, groups and rules. You can upload your own "
"YAML, or let OpenClash keep a subscription up to date."
msgstr ""
"配置文件包含节点、策略组和规则。您可以上传自己的 YAML，也可以让 OpenClash "
"自动更新订阅。"

msgid "Upload file"
msgstr "上传文件"

msgid "drop a YAML file (max 10MB)"
msgstr "拖入 YAML 文件（最大 10MB）"

msgid "Subscribe link"
msgstr "订阅链接"

msgid ""
"paste an http(s) address; advanced options can convert the subscription "
"online and filter nodes (for example drop “expire” / “traffic left” "
"entries)"
msgstr ""
"粘贴 http(s) 地址；高级选项可在线转换订阅并筛选节点（例如去掉“到期时间 / "
"剩余流量”条目）"

msgid ""
"Anything added here also shows up in “Config Manage” and in the selector "
"of the next step."
msgstr "此处添加的内容也会出现在“配置文件管理”和下一步的配置选择器中。"

msgid ""
"Add Config File offers two tabs: upload a file, or paste a subscribe link."
msgstr "“添加配置文件”有两个页签：上传文件，或粘贴订阅链接。"

msgid ""
"You may keep several configs; only one is active at a time. Switching "
"restarts the core automatically."
msgstr "可以保留多个配置，但同时只有一个生效，切换后内核会自动重启。"

msgid "Switch config"
msgstr "切换配置"

msgid ""
"On the overview page the same selector also shows subscription traffic "
"and expiry."
msgstr "概览页的同一个选择器还会显示订阅流量与到期时间。"

msgid ""
"The first start downloads GEO data and builds the firewall rules, so give "
"it 5–30 seconds."
msgstr "首次启动会下载 GEO 数据并生成防火墙规则，请等待 5–30 秒。"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Debug log"
msgstr "调试日志"

msgid ""
"If it keeps failing, generate a debug log and ask an AI or open an issue "
"with it attached."
msgstr "如果一直失败，请生成调试日志，将其交给 AI 或附在 Issue 中提交。"

msgid "The status turns green when the core is ready."
msgstr "内核就绪后状态会变成绿色。"

msgid "Mode and dashboard"
msgstr "模式与控制面板"

msgid ""
"The defaults suit most users: Fake-IP + Mix + Rule. TUN handles more "
"traffic types but needs kernel support."
msgstr ""
"默认配置适合多数用户：Fake-IP + 混合 + 规则。TUN 能接管更多流量类型，但需"
"要内核支持。"

msgid "DNS mode"
msgstr "DNS 模式"

msgid "Traffic forwarding"
msgstr "流量转发"

msgid "Copy panel address"
msgstr "复制面板地址"

msgid "Copy secret"
msgstr "复制密钥"

msgid ""
"The overview page shows the same switches; the guide keeps them in one "
"place."
msgstr "概览页有相同的开关，这里只是将它们集中在一处。"

msgid ""
"These switches are the ones people touch most often. Every change is "
"written to UCI immediately, just like on the overview page."
msgstr "这些是最常调整的开关；每次修改都会立即写入 UCI，与概览页一致。"

msgid "Bypass Specified Regions Network Flows, Improve Performance"
msgstr "绕过指定地区流量，提升性能"

msgid "Copy AI prompt"
msgstr "复制 AI 提示词"

msgid ""
"A debug log answers most questions: it contains dependency checks, "
"firewall rules, DNS and connectivity tests in one file."
msgstr ""
"调试日志能回答大部分问题：它把依赖检查、防火墙规则、DNS 与连通性测试都集中"
"在一个文件里。"

msgid ""
"Open “Server Logs → Debug Logs → Generate Logs”, then copy the result."
msgstr "打开“运行日志 → 调试日志 → 生成日志”，然后复制结果。"

msgid ""
"Paste it to any AI, or use “Copy AI prompt” above and attach the log."
msgstr "将其粘贴给任意 AI，或使用上面的“复制 AI 提示词”并附上日志。"

msgid "Three tabs: plugin logs, core logs and the generated debug log."
msgstr "三个页签：插件日志、内核日志和生成的调试日志。"

msgid "To do"
msgstr "待完成"

msgid "steps completed"
msgstr "个步骤已完成"

msgid "Start OpenClash first, then open the dashboard"
msgstr "请先启动 OpenClash，再打开控制面板"

msgid ""
"This dashboard is not installed, download it in Plugin Settings - "
"Dashboard Settings"
msgstr "该控制面板未安装，请在“插件设置 - 控制面板设置”中下载"

msgid ""
"The Config File card: pick a config in the selector, then press the "
"switch button."
msgstr "配置文件卡片：在选择器中选择配置，然后点击切换按钮。"

msgid ""
"Once the core runs, the statistics on the overview page keep updating."
msgstr "内核运行后，概览页的运行数据会持续刷新。"

msgid "View logs"
msgstr "查看日志"

msgid ""
"Switch to Debug Logs below, press Generate Logs and wait until it stops "
"streaming."
msgstr "在下方切换到“调试日志”，点击“生成日志”，等待输出结束。"

msgid ""
"Copy the log, or press “Copy AI prompt” and attach the log to your "
"question."
msgstr "复制日志，或点击“复制 AI 提示词”，把日志附在问题里一起发送。"

msgid "Copy log"
msgstr "复制日志"

msgid "No log content yet"
msgstr "暂无日志内容"

msgid "Log copied!"
msgstr "日志已复制！"

msgid ""
"Tick the features you want and apply them in one click — the guide covers "
"the options people normally look for in the settings pages."
msgstr ""
"勾选你需要的功能，一键启用即可——这里覆盖了通常要在设置页里寻找的常用选项。"

msgid "Enable Selected"
msgstr "启用所选"

msgid "Select Recommended"
msgstr "选择推荐项"

msgid "Common operations"
msgstr "常用操作"

msgid ""
"Route traffic of the selected region directly, so local sites are not "
"sent through the proxy."
msgstr "将所选地区的流量直连，本地网站不再经过代理。"

msgid "Domain Sniffer"
msgstr "域名嗅探"

msgid ""
"Take over all TCP and UDP traffic with a virtual network card, including "
"games and other non-HTTP protocols. Needs kernel support."
msgstr ""
"通过虚拟网卡接管全部 TCP/UDP 流量，包括游戏等非 HTTP 协议；需要内核支持。"

msgid "Detailed Logs"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid ""
"Write debug level core logs, which makes troubleshooting easier. Turn it "
"back to info when you are done."
msgstr "输出 debug 级别内核日志，便于排查问题；排查完成后请改回 info。"

msgid "feature(s) selected"
msgstr "项已选择"

msgid "Features already enabled are marked, tick the ones you need."
msgstr "已启用的功能会标注出来，勾选你需要的即可。"

msgid "Nothing to apply, tick the features you want first"
msgstr "没有可应用的项目，请先勾选需要的功能"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgid "Applying"
msgstr "正在应用"

msgid ""
"OpenClash needs a Mihomo core. One click matches the core to your CPU, "
"downloads and installs it."
msgstr ""
"OpenClash 需要 Mihomo 内核。一键安装会根据 CPU 架构匹配、下载并安装内核。"

msgid ""
"A config holds your proxies, groups and rules. Upload your own YAML, or "
"let OpenClash keep a subscription up to date."
msgstr ""
"配置文件包含节点、策略组和规则。你可以上传自己的 YAML，也可以让 OpenClash "
"自动更新订阅。"

msgid ""
"Pick a config in this list and switch to it. Only one is active at a time "
"and switching restarts the core."
msgstr ""
"在列表中选择一个配置并切换。同一时间只有一个生效，切换后内核会重启。"

msgid ""
"The defaults suit most users: Fake-IP + Mix + Rule. TUN takes over more "
"traffic types but needs kernel support."
msgstr ""
"默认设置适合多数用户：Fake-IP + 混合 + 规则。TUN 能接管更多流量类型，但需"
"要内核支持。"

msgid ""
"Click the highlighted buttons to change them, or use the recommended "
"defaults:"
msgstr "可直接点击高亮处的按钮修改，或使用推荐配置："

msgid ""
"The dashboard shows nodes, latency and live connections. Open it once the "
"core is running."
msgstr "控制面板可查看节点、延迟与实时连接，内核运行后即可打开。"

msgid "Skip"
msgstr "跳过"

msgid ""
"The OpenClash menu is split into several pages, each one owns a part of "
"the setup:"
msgstr "OpenClash 的菜单分为几个页面，每页负责一部分设置："

msgid ""
"start and stop the plugin, switch modes, select the config, open the "
"dashboard."
msgstr "启停插件、切换模式、选择配置、打开控制面板。"

msgid ""
"run mode, DNS, traffic control, access control, IPv6, auto restart, "
"dashboard download."
msgstr "运行模式、DNS、流量控制、访问控制、IPv6、自动重启、面板下载。"

msgid "override the generated config with your own values."
msgstr "用自己的参数覆盖自动生成的配置。"

msgid "convert a subscription, filter nodes, keep it updated automatically."
msgstr "订阅转换、节点筛选、自动更新。"

msgid "upload, rename, download and remove config files."
msgstr "上传、重命名、下载、删除配置文件。"

msgid "core logs, plugin logs and the one click debug log."
msgstr "内核日志、插件日志与一键调试日志。"

msgid "Two versions are shown here, and they update independently:"
msgstr "这里显示两个版本，各自独立更新："

msgid ""
"the LuCI plugin itself. A new release usually brings UI changes and new "
"options."
msgstr "LuCI 插件本体，升级通常带来界面变化与新选项。"

msgid ""
"the Mihomo core that does the proxying. This is the one that matters most."
msgstr "真正负责代理的 Mihomo 内核，最需要关注它。"

msgid ""
"When the core version shows a dash, no core is installed yet, use the "
"update entry to install one."
msgstr "内核版本显示为短横线表示尚未安装内核，可通过更新入口安装。"

msgid ""
"The generator rebuilds the Mihomo config on every change, so manual edits "
"are lost. The overwrite module keeps your own settings on top of it."
msgstr ""
"生成器每次都会重建 Mihomo 配置，手动修改会被覆盖；覆写模块可以把你的设置叠"
"加在上面。"

msgid ""
"Open it to pin values such as DNS, ports or TUN options, or to inject a "
"raw config fragment."
msgstr "打开后可固定 DNS、端口、TUN 等参数，或注入自定义配置片段。"

msgid "Install or update the core"
msgstr "安装或更新内核"

msgid ""
"OpenClash needs a Mihomo core. The one click install matches the core to "
"your CPU, downloads and installs it."
msgstr "OpenClash 需要 Mihomo 内核；一键安装会自动匹配 CPU 架构并下载安装。"

msgid ""
"Once it is installed, use the update entry to move to another release, "
"branch, or the smart core."
msgstr "安装完成后，可用更新入口切换其他版本、分支或智能内核。"

msgid "Open update"
msgstr "打开更新"

msgid ""
"answers DNS with a fake address and resolves the real one after the rules "
"match. It is the default: faster and resistant to DNS pollution."
msgstr ""
"先用假 IP 应答 DNS，规则命中后再解析真实地址。默认模式，更快且抗 DNS 污"
"染。"

msgid ""
"uses real addresses, which suits a few local or legacy services, but is "
"easier to poison."
msgstr "使用真实地址，适合个别本地或老旧服务，但更容易被 DNS 污染。"

msgid ""
"Switching restarts the core, the existing connections are dropped for a "
"moment."
msgstr "切换会重启内核，现有连接会短暂中断。"

msgid "Run Mode"
msgstr "运行模式"

msgid "How OpenClash takes over the traffic:"
msgstr "OpenClash 接管流量的方式："

msgid "redirect mode, TCP only. The safest choice, works on every kernel."
msgstr "重定向模式，仅处理 TCP，最稳妥，兼容所有内核。"

msgid ""
"virtual network card, takes over TCP and UDP, including games and other "
"non-HTTP protocols."
msgstr "虚拟网卡接管 TCP 与 UDP，覆盖游戏等非 HTTP 流量。"

msgid ""
"TUN plus redirect, the recommended default: UDP goes through TUN while "
"TCP stays fast."
msgstr "TUN 加重定向，推荐默认：UDP 走 TUN，TCP 保持高效。"

msgid ""
"TUN and Mix need the TUN kernel module and the packages it depends on."
msgstr "TUN 与混合模式需要内核的 TUN 模块及依赖包。"

msgid "Which traffic is sent through a proxy at all:"
msgstr "哪些流量会走代理："

msgid ""
"follow the rules of the config, domestic traffic goes direct "
"(recommended)."
msgstr "按配置里的规则分流，国内流量直连（推荐）。"

msgid ""
"send everything through the proxy, useful to check whether a node works."
msgstr "全部流量走代理，便于检测节点是否可用。"

msgid "send nothing through the proxy, useful to compare results."
msgstr "全部流量直连，便于对比排查。"

msgid ""
"The dashboard shows nodes, latency and live connections. One of these "
"buttons appears for each dashboard you have installed."
msgstr ""
"控制面板可查看节点、延迟与实时连接；每安装一个面板，这里就会多一个按钮。"

msgid ""
"Downloading a dashboard can take a while, the button shows up right after "
"the download finishes."
msgstr "面板下载可能需要一会儿，下载完成后按钮会立即出现。"

msgid "Config Source"
msgstr "配置来源"

msgid "A config can come from two places, switch between them any time:"
msgstr "配置有两种来源，可随时切换："

msgid "a ready made YAML file from your computer or your provider."
msgstr "本地或机场提供的现成 YAML 文件。"

msgid "a subscription URL, OpenClash keeps it updated from then on."
msgstr "订阅链接，之后由 OpenClash 自动更新。"

msgid ""
"Click this area to pick a file, or drag one onto it. Only .yaml and .yml "
"files up to 10 MB are accepted."
msgstr "点击此处选择文件，或把文件拖进来；仅支持 10 MB 以内的 .yaml/.yml。"

msgid ""
"Ticking this reveals the extra options for the selected source, such as a "
"custom user agent or the online conversion settings."
msgstr "勾选后展开当前来源的额外选项，例如自定义 UA、在线转换设置。"

msgid "A plain file upload usually needs nothing here."
msgstr "单纯上传文件通常无需设置。"

msgid ""
"Give the config a name (the file name is used by default) and confirm. A "
"config with the same name is replaced."
msgstr "给配置起个名字（默认取文件名）并确认；同名配置会被替换。"

msgid ""
"The new config is added but not switched to automatically, unless it is "
"the first one."
msgstr "新配置只会被添加，不会自动切换（第一个配置除外）。"

msgid ""
"The subscription tab builds the config from a URL, so it can be refreshed "
"later automatically."
msgstr "订阅页签会用链接生成配置，之后可自动更新。"

msgid ""
"Paste the subscription URL of your provider. Several links are allowed, "
"one per line, they end up in the same config."
msgstr "粘贴机场订阅链接；支持多个链接，每行一个，会合并到同一份配置。"

msgid ""
"Update Interval in Config Subscribe decides how often the core refreshes "
"it."
msgstr "刷新频率由「配置订阅」里的更新间隔决定。"

msgid ""
"Some providers only answer a specific client user agent. Pick one here, "
"or choose Custom to type your own."
msgstr "部分机场只认特定客户端 UA；可在此选择，或选「自定义」自行填写。"

msgid ""
"Optional. A converter rewrites the subscription on a remote server, which "
"is useful when the provider only speaks Clash format, or when you want a "
"template and node filtering."
msgstr ""
"可选。转换器会在远端服务器重写订阅，适合机场只提供 Clash 格式，或需要模板"
"与节点筛选的情况。"

msgid ""
"The subscription URL is sent to that third party service, so leave it off "
"if that matters to you."
msgstr "订阅链接会发送给该第三方服务，介意的话请不要开启。"

msgid ""
"Name the config and confirm. OpenClash downloads the subscription and "
"writes the YAML for you."
msgstr "命名并确认后，OpenClash 会下载订阅并生成 YAML。"

msgid "Update Center"
msgstr "更新中心"

msgid ""
"This window installs and updates the plugin, the core and the GEO data. "
"The header holds refresh, close and the drag handle."
msgstr ""
"此窗口用于安装与更新插件、内核和 GEO 数据；顶部栏提供刷新、关闭和拖动。"

msgid "CPU Architecture"
msgstr "CPU 架构"

msgid ""
"Detected from your router, it decides which core binary is downloaded. "
"Leave it as it is unless you know better."
msgstr "自动从路由器识别，决定下载哪个内核；除非你很清楚，否则不要改。"

msgid "Core Parameters"
msgstr "内核参数"

msgid "the core release to install, usually the latest one."
msgstr "要安装的内核版本，通常选最新。"

msgid "dev tracks new features, main is the stable line."
msgstr "dev 跟进新特性，main 为稳定分支。"

msgid ""
"the smart core adds latency based node selection, if your package "
"supports it."
msgstr "智能内核按延迟优选节点（需软件源支持）。"

msgid "Installed and available versions"
msgstr "已安装与可选版本"

msgid ""
"Left column is the plugin, right column is the core. Each one shows the "
"installed version and a list of versions to install."
msgstr "左列是插件，右列是内核；各自显示已安装版本和可安装版本列表。"

msgid ""
"Picking an older version is the way to roll back after a bad release."
msgstr "选择旧版本即可在遇到问题时回退。"

msgid "Mirror and download"
msgstr "镜像与下载"

msgid ""
"The download mirrors are tested for latency, then listed per version."
msgstr "下载镜像会先测延迟，再按版本列出。"

msgid "Click a mirror row to update everything from that mirror."
msgstr "点击整行镜像 = 从该镜像更新全部。"

msgid "Click a version number to update just that one."
msgstr "点击版本号 = 只更新该版本。"

msgid "Add your own CDN if every mirror is slow or unreachable."
msgstr "如果所有镜像都很慢或无法访问，可添加自己的 CDN。"

msgid ""
"Backup and restore cover the whole OpenClash configuration, the third "
"button removes the installed core."
msgstr "备份与恢复针对整个 OpenClash 配置，第三个按钮用于卸载已安装的内核。"

msgid ""
"No dashboard installed yet, download one in Plugin Settings - Dashboard "
"Settings."
msgstr "尚未安装控制面板，可在「插件设置 - 仪表盘设置」下载。"

msgid ""
"Click the switch in the highlighted area to start or stop the plugin."
msgstr "点击高亮处的开关即可启动或停止插件。"

msgid "Click the highlighted button to switch."
msgstr "点击高亮处的按钮即可切换。"

msgid ""
"Click the highlighted button to open the config dialog, this guide "
"continues inside it."
msgstr "点击高亮处的按钮打开配置弹窗，引导会在弹窗里继续。"

msgid ""
"The dashboard shows nodes, latency and live connections. One button "
"appears here for each dashboard you have installed."
msgstr ""
"控制面板可查看节点、延迟与实时连接；每安装一个面板，这里就会出现一个按钮。"

msgid "Click one of them to open it, Zashboard is the recommended one."
msgstr "点击即可打开，推荐使用 Zashboard。"

msgid ""
"One click maintenance, and the entry for installing or updating the core:"
msgstr "一键维护，同时也是安装/更新内核的入口："

msgid ""
"install or update the plugin, the core and the GEO data. A missing core "
"is installed from here."
msgstr "安装或更新插件、内核与 GEO 数据；内核缺失时也从这里安装。"

msgid "drop all current connections, useful after switching nodes."
msgstr "断开当前所有连接，切换节点后很有用。"

msgid ""
"Open the highlighted button to pin values such as DNS, ports or TUN "
"options, or to inject a raw config fragment. This guide continues inside "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"点击高亮处的按钮可固定 DNS、端口、TUN 等参数，或注入自定义配置片段；引导会"
"在编辑器里继续。"

msgid ""
"The two icons in the highlighted area switch the DNS mode, they belong to "
"the Running Mode card:"
msgstr "高亮处的两个图标用来切换 DNS 模式，它们属于上面的「运行模式」卡片："

msgid ""
"Three ways to take over the traffic, the highlighted group is the whole "
"choice:"
msgstr "接管流量的三种方式，高亮处就是全部选项："

msgid ""
"Overwrite modules are edited like a file, the header holds download, save "
"and close."
msgstr "覆写模块按文件的方式编辑，顶部栏有下载、保存和关闭。"

msgid ""
"Save writes the module only, the core picks it up the next time it "
"reloads."
msgstr "保存只写入模块本身，内核下次重载时才会生效。"

msgid ""
"Everything written here is merged into the generated config, a wrong "
"value can break the core. Change one module at a time and keep a backup."
msgstr ""
"这里的内容会合并进生成的配置，写错可能导致内核无法启动；建议一次只改一个模"
"块并先做备份。"

msgid ""
"Each entry is a small module that is applied on top of the generated "
"config, pick one to edit it."
msgstr ""
"列表里的每一项都是一个小模块，会叠加到生成的配置之上，点击即可编辑。"

msgid "The button at the bottom of the list adds a new module."
msgstr "列表底部的按钮可以新建模块。"

msgid "Editing area"
msgstr "编辑区"

msgid ""
"This is the module content, mostly YAML blocks that override single "
"values of the generated config."
msgstr "这里是模块内容，多为 YAML 片段，用于覆盖生成配置里的个别字段。"

msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "快捷键"

msgid ""
"The left side shows whether the module has unsaved changes. F11 goes "
"fullscreen, Escape leaves it, Ctrl with the mouse wheel zooms."
msgstr ""
"左侧显示模块是否有未保存的改动；F11 全屏、Esc 退出全屏、Ctrl + 滚轮缩放。"

msgid "Two ways to get a config, pick one here, you can switch later:"
msgstr "获取配置有两种方式，在这里选择，之后仍可切换："

msgid "you already have a YAML file, it is used as it is."
msgstr "已有 YAML 文件，会直接使用。"

msgid "you have a subscription URL, OpenClash can refresh it later."
msgstr "有订阅链接，OpenClash 之后可以自动更新。"

msgid ""
"Not sure about the advanced options? A plain file upload needs none of "
"them."
msgstr "不确定高级选项怎么填？单纯上传文件则全都不需要。"

msgid ""
"Keep or change the name, then press the add button. This name is what you "
"see in the config list later."
msgstr ""
"可以保留或修改名称，然后点击添加按钮；这个名字就是之后配置列表里显示的名"
"称。"

msgid ""
"A config with the same name is replaced, and the first one is switched to "
"automatically."
msgstr "同名配置会被替换，第一份配置会自动切换。"

msgid "How to add a subscription"
msgstr "如何添加订阅"

msgid ""
"Switch to the subscription tab, OpenClash then builds the config from a "
"URL and can refresh it for you."
msgstr ""
"切换到「订阅」标签页，OpenClash 会用链接生成配置，之后还能自动更新。"

msgid "Paste the subscription URL"
msgstr "粘贴订阅链接"

msgid ""
"Paste the link from your provider. Several links are allowed, one per "
"line, they end up in the same config."
msgstr "粘贴服务商提供的链接；可以填多条，每行一条，会合并到同一份配置。"

msgid ""
"Online conversion is optional too, only providers that do not speak Clash "
"format need it."
msgstr "在线转换同样是可选项，只有不提供 Clash 格式的服务商才需要。"

msgid ""
"Only change this when your provider asks for a specific client user "
"agent, otherwise keep the default."
msgstr "仅当服务商要求特定客户端 UA 时才需修改，否则保持默认。"

msgid ""
"Name it and press the add button. OpenClash downloads the subscription "
"and writes the YAML for you."
msgstr "取个名字并点击添加按钮，OpenClash 会下载订阅并生成 YAML。"

msgid ""
"The easiest way: click a mirror row with a low latency and everything is "
"updated from there."
msgstr "最简单的方式：点击延迟较低的镜像行，所有内容都会从该镜像更新。"

msgid ""
"Every mirror slow or unreachable? Add your own CDN at the bottom of the "
"list."
msgstr "所有镜像都很慢或无法访问？可在列表底部添加自定义 CDN。"

msgid "Update a single version"
msgstr "更新单个版本"

msgid ""
"Left column is the plugin, right column is the core. Click a version "
"number to install only that one."
msgstr "左列为插件、右列为内核；点击版本号可只安装该版本。"

msgid "adds latency based node selection, only on the smart core builds."
msgstr "按延迟选择节点，仅智能内核版本支持。"

msgid "detected automatically, just leave it alone."
msgstr "会自动检测，保持默认即可。"

msgid "Modules are grouped by topic, such as DNS, ports or TUN."
msgstr "模块按主题分组，例如 DNS、端口、TUN。"

msgid ""
"Pick the module you want to change, or add a new one with the button at "
"the bottom of the list."
msgstr "选择要修改的模块，或用列表底部的按钮新建一个。"

msgid ""
"What you write here is merged into the generated config, a wrong value "
"can break the core. Change one module at a time."
msgstr ""
"这里的内容会合并进生成的配置，写错可能导致内核无法启动；建议一次只改一个模"
"块。"

msgid ""
"Write the values you want to pin, then save with the button in the "
"header. The core applies them the next time it reloads."
msgstr "写入要固定的参数，再用顶部栏的按钮保存；内核下次重载时生效。"

msgid ""
"F11 goes fullscreen, Escape leaves it, Ctrl with the mouse wheel zooms "
"the text."
msgstr "F11 全屏，Esc 退出全屏，Ctrl + 滚轮缩放文字。"

msgid "Editor header"
msgstr "编辑器顶部"

msgid ""
"A Compare button also appears here when a plain config file is edited, it "
"shows the original and the running config side by side."
msgstr ""
"当编辑的是普通配置文件时，这里还会出现「比较」按钮，可并排查看原始配置与运"
"行时配置。"

msgid ""
"A config holds your proxies, groups and rules, so this is the step that "
"gets OpenClash working. Upload your own YAML file, or let OpenClash keep "
"a subscription up to date."
msgstr ""
"配置文件包含节点、分组和规则，这一步才真正让 OpenClash 跑起来：可以上传自"
"己的 YAML 文件，也可以让 OpenClash 自动维护订阅。"

msgid ""
"A subscription that the provider updates keeps your nodes fresh without "
"touching OpenClash again."
msgstr "服务商会持续更新订阅，节点自动保持最新，无需再操作 OpenClash。"

msgid ""
"Advanced Options below is for special cases only, a plain file upload "
"needs none of them."
msgstr "下面的「高级选项」只在特殊场景才需要，单纯上传文件不用管。"

msgid ""
"Both are installed and updated from one place: the Check Update button in "
"the Quick Action card further down, this guide opens that window for you "
"later."
msgstr ""
"两者的安装和更新都在同一个入口：下面「快捷操作」卡里的「检查更新」按钮，稍"
"后引导会帮你打开这个窗口。"

msgid "Changing a selector refreshes the mirror list below to that version."
msgstr "切换下拉框后，下面的镜像列表会刷新为该版本。"

msgid ""
"Every entry is a small module that is applied on top of the generated "
"config, the header shows how many there are."
msgstr "每一项都是一个小模块，会叠加到生成的配置之上，顶部会显示模块数量。"

msgid "Five small buttons live next to the list, from left to right:"
msgstr "列表旁边有五个小按钮，从左到右依次是："

msgid ""
"Four fields in one row: the installed plugin version, the plugin version "
"you want, the installed core version and the core version you want."
msgstr ""
"一行四个字段：已安装的插件版本、要安装的插件版本、已安装的内核版本、要安装"
"的内核版本。"

msgid ""
"Keep the window open while it downloads, the log at the bottom of the "
"overview page reports the result."
msgstr "下载过程中请保持窗口打开，结果会在概览页底部的日志里显示。"

msgid "Leave both on Latest to always get the newest release."
msgstr "两个都保持「最新」即可总是装到最新版本。"

msgid ""
"Name it here. This name is what the config list shows and what the "
"subscription is stored under."
msgstr "在这里命名，这个名字既显示在配置列表里，也是订阅保存时使用的名字。"

msgid ""
"Not needed right after installing? Just skip, the module is only for "
"pinning your own values."
msgstr ""
"刚装好还用不上？可以直接跳过，覆写模块只在你要固定自己的参数时才需要。"

msgid "One row per mirror, with the latency and the version it carries:"
msgstr "每一行是一个镜像，显示延迟和它提供的版本："

msgid ""
"Online conversion sends your link to a third party, prefer your own "
"backend when you care about privacy."
msgstr "在线转换会把链接发送给第三方，在意隐私时建议用自己的转换后端。"

msgid ""
"Only touch these when the automatic detection picked the wrong "
"architecture."
msgstr "只有自动探测选错了架构时才需要改这里。"

msgid ""
"Paste the link from your provider. Several links are allowed, one per "
"line or separated by a vertical bar."
msgstr "粘贴服务商提供的链接；可以填多条，每行一条或用竖线分隔。"

msgid ""
"Pick a config in this list, then switch to it with the button beside it. "
"Only one config is active at a time and switching restarts the core."
msgstr ""
"在列表里选择一份配置，再用旁边的按钮切换过去；同一时间只有一份生效，切换会"
"重启内核。"

msgid "Pick an older version to roll back after a bad release."
msgstr "遇到有问题的版本时，可以选一个旧版本回滚。"

msgid ""
"Press F11 for fullscreen, Escape to leave it, hold Ctrl and use the mouse "
"wheel to zoom. The bottom right corner resizes the window."
msgstr ""
"F11 全屏、Esc 退出全屏、按住 Ctrl 滚轮缩放；右下角可以拖动调整窗口大小。"

msgid ""
"Press the blue button, OpenClash downloads the subscription and writes "
"the YAML for you."
msgstr "点击蓝色按钮，OpenClash 会下载订阅并生成 YAML。"

msgid ""
"Same window, same ✕ on the right. Only the tab decides whether a file or "
"a subscription is added."
msgstr ""
"同一个窗口，右上角同样是 ✕ 关闭；是上传文件还是添加订阅只由标签页决定。"

msgid ""
"Some providers only answer a specific client name, pick it here or choose "
"Custom and type your own."
msgstr ""
"有些服务商只对特定客户端名放行，可以在这里选择，或选「自定义」自己填写。"

msgid ""
"The button in the header collapses this list when you need more room for "
"the editor."
msgstr "需要更大编辑区时，用顶部按钮可以把列表折叠起来。"

msgid "The buttons on the right are the whole action set of this window:"
msgstr "右上角这几个按钮就是本窗口的全部操作："

msgid ""
"The buttons on the right refresh the version list and the mirror latency, "
"and the ✕ closes the window."
msgstr "右上角的按钮可以刷新版本列表和镜像延迟，✕ 关闭窗口。"

msgid ""
"The generator rebuilds the Mihomo config on every change, so hand written "
"edits are lost. The overwrite module keeps your own values on top of the "
"generated file."
msgstr ""
"生成器每次改动都会重建 Mihomo 配置，手写的修改会被覆盖；覆写模块把你的设置"
"固定在生成的配置之上。"

msgid ""
"The last three act straight away, the update one opens a window first. "
"Press “Open and continue” below and this guide explains that window."
msgstr ""
"后三个按钮是立即生效的，只有「检查更新」会先打开窗口；点击下面「打开并继"
"续」，引导会讲解这个窗口。"

msgid ""
"The left side shows what the download is doing right now, the right side "
"repeats the two ways in: a link updates everything, a version updates one "
"piece."
msgstr ""
"左侧显示当前下载动作，右侧重复两种更新方式：点链接全部更新、点版本号单独更"
"新。"

msgid ""
"The restart button next to it reloads the core, use it after changing a "
"config or an overwrite module."
msgstr "旁边的重启按钮用于重载内核，改过配置或覆写模块后使用。"

msgid ""
"The switch on the right enables or disables that module without deleting "
"it."
msgstr "右侧开关可以启用/停用该模块，不会删除它。"

msgid ""
"The tag tells where it comes from: a local module or a subscribed one, "
"built in or not configured yet."
msgstr "标签说明来源：本地模块还是订阅模块，内置还是尚未配置。"

msgid ""
"The title shows what this window is doing right now, it reads Add Config "
"File or Edit Config depending on how you opened it."
msgstr ""
"标题显示当前窗口在做什么：按打开方式显示「添加配置文件」或「编辑配置」。"

msgid "The title tells you which module is open right now."
msgstr "标题显示当前打开的是哪个模块。"

msgid ""
"The ✕ on the right closes the window, a running upload is cancelled with "
"it."
msgstr "右上角的 ✕ 关闭窗口，正在进行的上传也会被取消。"

msgid ""
"This card holds four one click buttons, the highlighted one installs and "
"updates everything:"
msgstr "这张卡里有四个一键按钮，高亮这个负责安装与更新全部内容："

msgid ""
"This is the entrance, remember it. Press “Open and continue” below, the "
"dialog opens by itself and this guide explains every field in it."
msgstr ""
"记住这个入口。点击下面「打开并继续」，窗口会自动打开，引导会逐个讲解里面的"
"字段。"

msgid ""
"This is the entrance, remember it. Press “Open and continue” below, the "
"editor opens by itself and this guide explains every part of it."
msgstr ""
"记住这个入口。点击下面「打开并继续」，编辑器会自动打开，引导会逐块讲解。"

msgid ""
"This is the module content, mostly YAML fragments such as DNS settings, "
"ports or TUN options. Only what you write here overrides the generated "
"value."
msgstr ""
"这里是模块内容，多为 YAML 片段（如 DNS、端口、TUN 参数）；只有写在这里的内"
"容会覆盖生成配置里的对应值。"

msgid ""
"This window installs and updates the plugin, the core and the GEO data. "
"It is also where a missing core is installed from."
msgstr ""
"这个窗口负责安装和更新插件、内核与 GEO 数据；内核缺失时也是从这里安装。"

msgid "Trim a big subscription down to the nodes you want:"
msgstr "把一个很大的订阅精简成你需要的节点："

msgid ""
"Turn this on when your provider does not hand out Clash format. The block "
"below then appears:"
msgstr "服务商不直接提供 Clash 格式时才需要打开，打开后会出现下面的区块："

msgid "Two rarely needed extras:"
msgstr "两个很少用到的附加项："

msgid ""
"You are on the subscription tab now, OpenClash builds the config from a "
"URL and can refresh it for you later."
msgstr "现在在订阅标签页：OpenClash 会用链接生成配置，之后还能自动更新。"

msgid ""
"add HTTP headers to the subscription request, some providers need them."
msgstr "给订阅请求添加 HTTP 请求头，部分服务商需要。"

msgid ""
"change the link, the User-Agent or the conversion options of a "
"subscription."
msgstr "修改订阅链接、User-Agent 或转换选项。"

msgid ""
"click the link to update everything from that mirror, this is the easy "
"path."
msgstr "点链接会用该镜像全部更新，这是最省事的方式。"

msgid "create an empty module at the bottom of the list."
msgstr "在列表底部新建一个空模块。"

msgid ""
"delete the installed core, useful to free space or to force a clean "
"reinstall."
msgstr "删除已安装的内核，用于释放空间或强制重新安装。"

msgid "drop nodes whose name contains these words."
msgstr "排除名称里包含这些词的节点。"

msgid ""
"drop the provider info nodes such as expiry, traffic, plan or website."
msgstr "排除服务商信息节点，例如到期时间、流量、套餐、官网。"

msgid ""
"export the whole setup, the dropdown narrows it down to the cores, the "
"config, the rules or the proxy providers."
msgstr "导出整套配置；下拉框可以只备份内核、配置、规则或代理集。"

msgid "extra converter arguments, only for advanced setups."
msgstr "额外的转换参数，仅高级用法需要。"

msgid ""
"generate or paste an Age key pair to encrypt the sensitive parts of a "
"config."
msgstr "生成或粘贴 Age 密钥对，用于加密配置里的敏感内容。"

msgid ""
"keep only nodes whose name contains one of these words, eg hk or tw&bgp."
msgstr "只保留名称包含这些词的节点，例如 hk 或 tw&bgp。"

msgid ""
"measured here, a slow mirror means a slow download, not a slow proxy."
msgstr "这里实测的延迟；镜像慢只影响下载速度，不影响代理速度。"

msgid ""
"open this config in the editor, the same window the overwrite module uses."
msgstr "用编辑器打开这份配置，和覆写模块用的是同一个窗口。"

msgid "refresh a subscription config, useful when the provider adds nodes."
msgstr "重新拉取订阅配置，服务商新增节点时使用。"

msgid ""
"save the current content to a file on your computer, handy as a backup."
msgstr "把当前内容保存到电脑上，方便备份。"

msgid "small switches that change the converted output."
msgstr "几个影响转换结果的小开关。"

msgid "switch between RAW and CDN, use CDN when a download keeps failing."
msgstr "在 RAW（直连）和 CDN（走代理）之间切换，下载经常失败时用 CDN。"

msgid "the entrance to add another config file or subscription."
msgstr "添加另一份配置文件或订阅的入口。"

msgid ""
"the rule template applied to the result, this decides the group names."
msgstr "应用到转换结果的规则模板，它决定分组名称。"

msgid "which release line to follow, the default is fine for normal use."
msgstr "跟随哪条发布分支，日常使用保持默认即可。"

msgid ""
"write the module back. The core picks it up the next time it reloads."
msgstr "把模块写回；内核下次重载时生效。"

msgid ""
"The ✕ in the top right corner closes this window. An upload that is "
"already running is cancelled with it."
msgstr "右上角的 ✕ 关闭这个窗口，正在进行的上传也会一并取消。"

msgid ""
"Cancel at the bottom does the same, the button in the middle of the "
"footer is the one that really adds the config."
msgstr "底部的「取消」效果相同，真正执行添加的是底栏中间那个按钮。"

msgid "A config can come in two ways, the two tabs switch between them:"
msgstr "配置有两种来源，用这两个标签页切换："

msgid ""
"you already have a YAML file. The file is copied in as it is, nothing is "
"generated."
msgstr "已经有 YAML 文件，原样复制进来，不会做任何生成或转换。"

msgid ""
"you have a subscription URL from a provider. OpenClash downloads it and "
"can refresh it later, so the nodes stay up to date."
msgstr ""
"有服务商提供的订阅链接，OpenClash 会下载它并可随时刷新，节点自动保持最新。"

msgid ""
"Click Subscribe Link and this guide follows you there: the URL, the User-"
"Agent, the optional conversion, node filtering and the name are all "
"explained."
msgstr ""
"点「订阅链接」标签页，引导会跟着切过去，逐个讲解订阅地址、User-Agent、可选"
"的在线转换、节点筛选和名称。"

msgid ""
"Both kinds end up in the same config list, and both can be refreshed from "
"there."
msgstr "两种方式最终都进入同一个配置列表，也都能在那里刷新。"

msgid ""
"The ✕ in the top right corner closes the window, the footer button adds "
"or saves the subscription."
msgstr "右上角的 ✕ 关闭窗口，底栏按钮负责添加或保存订阅。"

msgid ""
"The tab stays switchable, a plain YAML file is added through the other "
"one."
msgstr "标签页随时可以切换，普通的 YAML 文件走另一个标签页添加。"

msgid ""
"The buttons in the top right corner are the whole action set of this "
"window:"
msgstr "右上角这几个按钮就是这个窗口的全部操作："

msgid ""
"The generator rebuilds the Mihomo config on every change, so hand written "
"edits are lost. The overwrite module keeps your own settings on top of "
"the generated file."
msgstr ""
"生成器每次改动都会重建 Mihomo 配置，手写的修改会被覆盖；覆写模块把你的设置"
"固定在生成的配置之上。"

msgid ""
"Use it to pin values such as DNS, ports or TUN options, or to inject a "
"raw config fragment."
msgstr "可以用它固定 DNS、端口、TUN 等参数，或注入一段自定义配置片段。"

msgid ""
"To open it, press the highlighted button. Press “Open and continue” below "
"instead and this guide opens the editor for you and explains every part "
"of it, button by button."
msgstr ""
"要打开它就点高亮处的按钮；也可以点下面的「打开并继续」，由引导帮你打开编辑"
"器，并逐块、逐个按钮地讲解。"

msgid ""
"Three ways to take over the traffic, the highlighted group holds all "
"three buttons:"
msgstr "接管流量有三种方式，高亮处就是这三个按钮："

msgid ""
"Click a button to switch. Each one restarts the core and drops the "
"current connections for a moment."
msgstr "点击按钮即可切换；每次切换都会重启内核，现有连接会短暂中断。"

msgid ""
"A config holds your proxies, groups and rules, so this is the step that "
"gets OpenClash working."
msgstr "配置文件包含节点、分组和规则，这一步才真正让 OpenClash 跑起来。"

msgid ""
"Two things happen in the window: first the buttons in its top right "
"corner, then the two ways to add a config. Uploading a file is one of "
"them, the other one is adding a subscription, which gets its own steps "
"when you switch to that tab."
msgstr ""
"窗口里会讲两件事：先是右上角按钮，再是两种添加方式——上传文件只是其中一种，"
"另一种是添加订阅，切到那个标签页后会有单独的讲解。"

msgid "Press “Open and continue” below and the dialog opens by itself."
msgstr "点下面的「打开并继续」，窗口会自动打开。"

msgid ""
"The other tab builds the config from a URL instead and keeps it "
"refreshable. What waits inside:"
msgstr "另一个标签页改为用链接生成配置，并且可以随时刷新。里面有："

msgid ""
"paste the link from your provider, several links are allowed, one per "
"line."
msgstr "粘贴服务商提供的链接，可以多条，每行一条。"

msgid "only some providers answer one specific client name."
msgstr "只有部分服务商要求特定的客户端名称。"

msgid "optional conversion, for providers that do not serve Clash format."
msgstr "可选的转换，服务商不提供 Clash 格式时才需要。"

msgid "keep or drop nodes by keyword before they reach the config."
msgstr "在写入配置之前按关键字保留或排除节点。"

msgid "custom request headers and Age encryption, rarely needed."
msgstr "自定义请求头和 Age 加密，很少用到。"

msgid "the name the config list shows, then the button that saves it."
msgstr "配置列表里显示的名称，然后是保存按钮。"

msgid "Click this tab and the guide switches to those steps right away."
msgstr "点这个标签页，引导会立刻切过去逐步讲解。"

msgid ""
"The button at the bottom of the list creates a module. A module is just a "
"small file with the settings you want to pin."
msgstr ""
"列表底部的按钮用于新建模块；模块就是一个只包含你要固定的设置的小文件。"

msgid ""
"Press “Open and continue” below and the add window opens, this guide "
"walks through it."
msgstr "点下面的「打开并继续」，添加窗口会自动打开，引导会带你逐项过一遍。"

msgid ""
"you write the content yourself, upload a txt or conf file, or start from "
"an empty one."
msgstr "自己编写内容，可以上传 txt/conf 文件，也可以从空白开始。"

msgid ""
"OpenClash downloads the module from a URL and can refresh it later, "
"useful for shared setups."
msgstr ""
"OpenClash 从链接下载模块，之后还能刷新，适合多人共用同一套配置的场景。"

msgid "Then fill in the three fields below:"
msgstr "然后在下面填三项："

msgid "The upload area takes a txt or conf file up to 10 MB."
msgstr "上传区接受 txt 或 conf 文件，最大 10 MB。"

msgid ""
"The ✕ in the top right corner closes the window without adding anything."
msgstr "右上角的 ✕ 关闭窗口，不会添加任何内容。"

msgid ""
"A new module is enabled right away. Write your values in the editor, "
"save, then reload the core so it takes effect."
msgstr ""
"新建的模块会直接启用；在编辑器里写好内容、保存，然后重载内核才会生效。"

msgid "Switch and continue"
msgstr "切换并继续"

msgid "The eight cards here are the live numbers of this device:"
msgstr "下面这八张卡是这台设备的实时数据："

msgid "the current speed, they move while traffic flows."
msgstr "当前速率，有流量时会跳动。"

msgid "counted since the core started, restarting the core resets them."
msgstr "从内核启动开始累计，重启内核会归零。"

msgid ""
"what the plugin costs the router, a high value is the first thing to "
"check when the network feels slow."
msgstr "插件对路由器的开销；网络变慢时先看这三项。"

msgid ""
"The View Mode buttons in the header switch between the cards and a curve."
msgstr "卡片右上角的 View Mode 按钮可以在数字卡片和曲线图之间切换。"

msgid ""
"The same query goes to four public IP services, so you can compare them:"
msgstr "同一个查询会发给四个公网 IP 服务，方便互相印证："

msgid ""
"They should all answer with the same address. A different one means that "
"service went direct or through another node."
msgstr "正常时四个结果应该一致；出现不同地址说明该服务走了直连或别的节点。"

msgid "The country and city under each address show where the exit is."
msgstr "每个地址下面的国家和城市就是出口节点所在地。"

msgid "Use the hide button in the next area before taking a screenshot."
msgstr "截图前记得用下一区域的隐藏按钮遮住地址。"

msgid ""
"the ones that usually need the proxy, a timeout here means the node or "
"the rule set does not cover them."
msgstr "通常需要走代理的站点；这里超时说明节点或规则没有覆盖它们。"

msgid ""
"The three buttons in the header hide the addresses, switch the router "
"mode and re-run the tests."
msgstr "标题右侧三个按钮分别是：隐藏地址、切换路由器模式、重新测试。"

msgid ""
"A subscription is the other way to get a config, and the more convenient "
"one when the provider keeps adding nodes."
msgstr "订阅是获取配置的另一种方式；服务商经常新增节点时更方便。"

msgid ""
"Press “Switch and continue” below and the window changes to that tab by "
"itself. This guide then explains what waits there:"
msgstr ""
"点下面的「切换并继续」，窗口会自动切到那个标签页，引导接着讲解里面的内容："

msgid ""
"Press “Switch and continue” and the window changes to that tab by itself. "
"The fields there are:"
msgstr "点「切换并继续」，窗口会自动切到那个标签页，里面的字段是："

msgid "file for something you write yourself, http for a link."
msgstr "file 表示自己编写的内容，http 表示从链接获取。"

msgid "the address the module is downloaded from, only for http."
msgstr "模块的下载地址，仅 http 类型需要。"

msgid "when OpenClash re-downloads it, for example every Monday at 3:00."
msgstr "OpenClash 重新下载的时间，例如每周一 3:00。"

msgid "extra variables handed to the script, for advanced modules."
msgstr "传给脚本的额外变量，仅高级模块需要。"

msgid ""
"The switch starts and stops the plugin. The button beside it restarts the "
"core."
msgstr "高亮区里的开关用于启动/停止插件；旁边的按钮用于重启内核。"

msgid ""
"Use the restart button after changing a config or an overwrite module, "
"the core only reads them when it reloads."
msgstr "改过配置或覆写模块后要按重启按钮，内核只有重载时才会读取这些改动。"

msgid ""
"The two icons in the highlighted area switch the DNS mode, they belong to "
"the Running Mode card. Active right now:"
msgstr ""
"高亮处的两个图标用于切换 DNS 模式，它们属于「运行模式」卡片。当前生效："

msgid ""
"Only needed when your provider does not hand out Clash format. Turn it on "
"and the whole block below unfolds, this guide walks through it next."
msgstr ""
"只有服务商不提供 Clash 格式时才需要打开；打开后下面的整块会展开，引导接着"
"逐项讲解。"

msgid "Where the conversion happens:"
msgstr "转换在哪里进行："

msgid ""
"the rule template applied to the result, this decides the group names. "
"Custom Template takes a URL of your own."
msgstr ""
"应用到转换结果的规则模板，它决定分组名称；「自定义模板」可以填自己的模板地"
"址。"

msgid "A public backend is the quickest start, your own one is safer."
msgstr "公共后端上手最快，自己的后端更安全。"

msgid ""
"Six switches change what the converter produces, none of them is required:"
msgstr "六个开关影响转换结果，都不是必选项："

msgid "add a country flag or emoji to the node name."
msgstr "在节点名前加上国旗或表情。"

msgid "keep UDP support, leave it on for games."
msgstr "保留 UDP 支持，玩游戏时保持开启。"

msgid "accept certificates that do not match, on by default."
msgstr "接受不匹配的证书，默认开启。"

msgid "sort the nodes by name."
msgstr "按名称对节点排序。"

msgid "write the protocol into the node name."
msgstr "把协议类型写进节点名。"

msgid "produce rule providers instead of inline rules."
msgstr "生成规则集（rule provider）而不是内联规则。"

msgid ""
"extra converter arguments such as rename rules, one per line, only for "
"advanced setups."
msgstr "额外的转换参数，例如重命名规则，每行一条，仅高级用法需要。"

msgid ""
"Trim a big subscription down to the nodes you want, the fields appear "
"below when it is on."
msgstr "把庞大的订阅精简成你想要的节点；开启后下面的字段才会出现。"

msgid ""
"keep only nodes whose name contains one of these words, eg hk or tw&bgp, "
"one per line."
msgstr "只保留名称包含这些词的节点，例如 hk 或 tw&bgp，每行一条。"

msgid "drop the provider info nodes, expiry, traffic, plan or website."
msgstr "排除服务商信息节点：到期时间、流量、套餐、官网。"

msgid ""
"Two rarely needed extras live behind this switch, both are explained next."
msgstr "这个开关后面是两个很少用到的附加项，下面会分别讲解。"

msgid ""
"Some providers only answer when the request carries a certain header, "
"such as their own domain as Referer."
msgstr ""
"有些服务商要求请求带上特定请求头才会响应，例如把它们的域名作为 Referer。"

msgid "Press the add button and fill in name and value, one row per header."
msgstr "点击添加按钮，填写名称和值，一个请求头一行。"

msgid ""
"Wrong headers make the download fail, so only add what the provider asks "
"for."
msgstr "请求头写错会导致下载失败，只添加服务商要求的内容。"

msgid ""
"Age encryption keeps the sensitive parts of a config, such as node "
"passwords, unreadable to anyone who gets the file."
msgstr "Age 加密让配置里的敏感内容（例如节点密码）对拿到文件的人也不可读。"

msgid ""
"Generate a key pair with the button in the header, or paste an existing "
"one."
msgstr "用标题右侧的按钮生成密钥对，也可以粘贴已有的密钥。"

msgid "stays on this router, it decrypts the config."
msgstr "留在本路由器上，用于解密配置。"

msgid "goes into the provider settings so it can encrypt for you."
msgstr "填到服务商设置里，让它为你加密。"

msgid ""
"Three ways to take over the traffic, the highlighted group holds all "
"three buttons. Active right now:"
msgstr "接管流量有三种方式，高亮处就是这三个按钮。当前生效："

msgid "Three buttons in the top right corner of the check area:"
msgstr "检查区右上角的三个按钮："

msgid ""
"blur the addresses, do it before taking a screenshot. The icon flips back "
"and forth."
msgstr "把地址打码，截图前先按它；图标会在显示/隐藏之间切换。"

msgid ""
"run the checks from the router itself or from this browser, the active "
"one is the one shown here."
msgstr "选择从路由器本身还是从当前浏览器发起检测，右侧显示的就是当前模式。"

msgid ""
"The two icons in the top right corner of this card change how the same "
"numbers are drawn:"
msgstr "这张卡右上角的两个图标改变同一组数据的展现方式："

msgid "A switch for the special cases, a plain upload leaves it off."
msgstr "特殊场景才需要打开的开关，普通上传保持关闭。"

msgid ""
"Turning it on unfolds the extra fields below, custom request headers and "
"an Age key so the file can carry encrypted values."
msgstr ""
"打开后会在下面展开额外字段：自定义请求头，以及让文件携带加密内容的 Age 密"
"钥。"

msgid ""
"The rule template decides the group names of the converted config. Custom "
"Template takes a URL of your own."
msgstr ""
"规则模板决定转换后配置的分组名称；「自定义模板」可以填自己的模板地址。"

msgid "Add a country flag or emoji to the node name."
msgstr "在节点名前加上国旗或表情。"

msgid "Keep UDP support, leave it on for games and voice chat."
msgstr "保留 UDP 支持，玩游戏和语音时保持开启。"

msgid ""
"Accept certificates that do not match the domain, on by default and "
"usually left that way."
msgstr "接受与域名不匹配的证书，默认开启，通常保持默认。"

msgid "Sort the nodes by name, which keeps a long list readable."
msgstr "按名称排序节点，长列表也更好找。"

msgid ""
"Write the protocol into the node name, so vless, hysteria and friends are "
"told apart at a glance."
msgstr "把协议写在节点名里，一眼就能区分 vless、hysteria 等类型。"

msgid ""
"Produce rule providers instead of inline rules, which keeps the config "
"shorter."
msgstr "生成规则集而不是内联规则，配置会更短。"

msgid "Extra converter arguments, one per line, for example a rename rule."
msgstr "额外的转换参数，每行一条，例如重命名规则。"

msgid ""
"Only needed when a provider asks for a special rule, otherwise leave it "
"empty."
msgstr "只有服务商要求特殊规则时才需要，否则留空。"

msgid ""
"Keep only the nodes whose name contains one of these words, one per line, "
"for example hk or tw&bgp."
msgstr "只保留名称包含这些词的节点，每行一条，例如 hk 或 tw&bgp。"

msgid ""
"Drop the nodes whose name contains these words, such as a trial or a "
"backup server."
msgstr "排除名称包含这些词的节点，例如试用或备用服务器。"

msgid ""
"Drop the provider info nodes. The four switches remove the entries that "
"only carry the expiry date, the traffic, the plan or the website."
msgstr ""
"去掉服务商信息节点：四个开关分别移除只带到期时间、流量、套餐、官网的条目。"

msgid ""
"The algorithm of the key pair, x25519 is the common one. Leave it as it "
"is unless you know why."
msgstr "密钥对的算法，常用的是 x25519；不清楚用途就保持默认。"

msgid ""
"Generate a key pair with the header button, or paste an existing one."
