msgid ""
"When I report any problem or error (cannot access internet, DNS failure, "
"startup failure, connection timeout, etc.), FIRST ask me to generate a "
"debug log — either via LuCI (**Server Logs → Debug Logs → Generate "
"Logs**) or SSH (`/usr/share/openclash/openclash_debug.sh`). The debug log "
"contains dependency checks, configuration, firewall rules, and system "
"info in one step — do NOT ask me to check things individually. (Note: "
"this rule does NOT apply to feature configuration questions like \"how do "
"I enable X?\" — see rule 3 for those.)"
msgstr ""
"当我报告任何故障或错误（无法上网、DNS 异常、启动失败、连接超时等）时，**首"
"先**要求我生成调试日志 —— 通过 LuCI（**运行日志 → 调试日志 → 生成日志**）"
"或 SSH（`/usr/share/openclash/openclash_debug.sh`）。调试日志一步包含依赖"
"检查、配置、防火墙规则和系统信息 —— **不要**让我逐项检查。（注意：此规则**"
"不适用**于功能配置类问题如「如何开启 XX？」—— 此类问题请参见规则 3。）"

msgid ""
"If the debug log is insufficient to pinpoint the issue, give me precise "
"diagnostic commands to run on the router and ask me to paste back the "
"output."
msgstr ""
"如果调试日志不足以定位问题，给我精确的诊断命令在路由器上执行，并让我粘贴输"
"出结果。"

msgid ""
"For feature configuration and post-diagnosis fixes, provide LuCI web UI "
"navigation paths (e.g. **Services → OpenClash → Plugin Settings**). Only "
"give command-line when LuCI is unavailable or I explicitly ask for it."
msgstr ""
"对于功能配置和诊断后的修复，提供 LuCI Web 界面操作路径（如 **服务 → "
"OpenClash → 插件设置**）。仅在 LuCI 不可用或我明确要求时才提供命令行。"

